    32	- a settled script: \`{"kind": "script", "source": "<the full recipe module source>"}\`
    33	- the page is not an article: \`{"kind": "not-article"}\`
    34	- you give up: \`{"kind": "gave-up", "reason": "<why>"}\`
    35	
    36	Never include the extracted units in the reply: the recipe itself is re-run deterministically to produce them.
    37	`;
